  message: "I think we (at least partially) already addressed this in a different tracker item and it did involve making tightening the stop logic behavior. I think the concerns raised here might be obviated by the Moitor being event-driven in that it still can finish sooner than its pre-providided duration if the thing it's monitoring sends a recognizable message. We might be able to `wont_do` this; what do you think?"  # 535a
